[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831086500","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105754#issuecomment-2831086500","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105754","id":2831086500,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ovvOk","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T18:05:51Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T18:05:51Z","body":"Obviously from that error the data arrays are not of the same length but the MRP does not show who or what and how this corrupted data was created. Can you add that info, else there is little that can be done here.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831086500/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831774668","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105754#issuecomment-2831774668","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105754","id":2831774668,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oyXPM","user":{"login":"Kogeume","id":29126544,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTI2NTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29126544?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume","html_url":"https://github.com/Kogeume","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T02:46:03Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T02:46:03Z","body":"Thank you for your reply.\nI remade the sample project.\n\n\n**Issue description:**\nData that cannot be read is created from Mesh created by ConvexShape3D.get_debug_mesh().\n\n**Supplement:**\nGDScript cannot create surface information from ConvexShape3D, so I use get_debug_mesh().\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Open the project\n2. Select the scene node \"TEST\"\n3. Run the debug button on the inspector panel\n4. Check the log. If there is a problem, ERROR is output\n\n＊\"Test B\" and \"Test C\" These two tests can confirm the problem.\n\n\n**Minimal reproduction project (MRP):**\n[nav_mesh_src_geo_data_3d_issue_2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19919381/nav_mesh_src_geo_data_3d_issue_2.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831774668/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832032268","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105754#issuecomment-2832032268","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105754","id":2832032268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ozWIM","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T10:54:39Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T10:54:39Z","body":"The collision `get_debug_mesh()` functions create a not valid mesh format. It has surfaces for line meshes. Those can't be used for the navmesh baking. Convex shapes are just point data, they need an entire convex hull compute step before they become useful for the navmesh baking. Concave shapes at least have the `get_faces()` functions that should return valid triangle faces.\n\nNot all meshes are equal. Only pure triangle meshes, either with or without index, and added with the add_mesh() or mesh_arrays() functions can work as they need to be decomposed into the float arrays and their indices.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832032268/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832207013","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105754#issuecomment-2832207013","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105754","id":2832207013,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o0Ayl","user":{"login":"Kogeume","id":29126544,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTI2NTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29126544?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume","html_url":"https://github.com/Kogeume","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kogeume/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T13:38:22Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T13:38:22Z","body":"As pointed out, I've calculated the convex hull to create an array of faces.\n\n**Suggestion:**\nAdd ’ERR_FAIL_COND(vertices.size() < p_indices.size());’  to the add_mesh function as well.\n\nI will close this issue in the form of a suggestion.\n_Thank you for your valuable time to address this issue._\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832207013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]